Read-only capability-compression preparation and comparison

Usage: lesscode-core.exe <COMMAND>

Commands:
  prepare  Freeze the baseline and reviewed manifest in a new external JSON file
  compare  Compare supplied roots and evidence; write result.json and report.md
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Exit codes: 0 prepared/accepted; 1 rejected/not-demonstrated; 2 incomplete; 3 invalid input, baseline-ineligible or IO failure. Reports require fresh output outside source roots. Checks are supplied, never executed.
